BOOST YOUR CAREER & BALANCE YOUR LIFE IN THE NETHERLANDS 


WE ARE LOOKING FOR DOCTORS! 
Our clients are mental health institutions and occupational health companies, seeking Doctors for various locations across the country. 

MENTAL HEALTH & OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH 
We support you with: 
•    language course 
•    Accommodation 
•    integration in the country 
•    and much more... 


Doctors to work in Mental Health Institutions 
•    Starting monthly salary: €4977 (after specialization, monthly salary up to €10.616); 
•    With or without experience or specialization; 
•    Several locations around the country; 
•    Coverage of home-to-work travel costs; 36-hour workweek; 
•    Offer of Dutch language training A1-B2+ (online + in-person) + books + scholarship during the online training for personal expenses + accommodation and food allowance during the in-person training. 

 OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH  

Doctors to work in Occupational Health 
•    Starting monthly salary; €4000-€5.066 + annual progression; 
•    With or without experience or specialization. 
•    Several locations around the country 
•    Coverage of home-to-work travel costs; 40-hour workweek; 
•    Offer of Dutch language training A1-B2+ (online + in-person) + books + scholarship during the online training for personal expenses + accommodation and food allowance during the in-person training. 



Other benefits all our vacancies have in common: 
•    Annual salary progression; 
•    Year-end bonus (8.33% of your annual salary); Holiday allowance (8.33% of your annual salary); Support with finding a fully furnished home ready for immediate move-in; 
•    Support/assistance in work and private life, through a coach; 
•    Big register costs; 
•    Dutch official language exam costs. 

Additional benefits may also be available depending on the employer. 


CORE REQUIREMENTS     
•    Good English level; Degree in the EU; 
•    Time and dedication to attend the Dutch course. 

Please note that additional requirements may apply depending on the specific vacancy. 


LANGUAGE TRAINING     
Our Dutch Language Training (A1-B2+) begins with 11 weeks of online classes, followed by 6 weeks of in-person classes in Portugal, and then 8 weeks of in-person classes in the Netherlands. 
We cover accommodation, provide books, and offer an allowance for personal expenses. 
Once in the Netherlands, but before starting your job, enjoy additional workshops to further enhance your language skills. 

WHY THE NETHERLANDS? 
This country offers more than just a job. It provides a lifestyle! Here’s why moving could be the best decision of your life: 
•    top-tier healthcare system; 
•    work-life balance; 
•    career growth opportunities; 
•    welcoming community; 
•    cultural richness. 
If you would like to learn more about these vacancies or to be updated about other opportunities we have available, please feel free to contact us with any questions. 

